---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../consts";
---

<Layout title="TTTL - Um okkur">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl mb-8">
      Um okkur
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-700 space-y-6">
      <p>
        Tæki og Tól Til Leigu (TTTL) er fjölskyldufyrirtæki sem býður upp á leigu á ýmsum tækjum og tólum fyrir einstaklinga og fyrirtæki.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Hafa samband</h2>
      <ul class="list-none space-y-2 pl-0">
        <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-900">Eigandi:</span> {SITE.owner}</li>
        <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-900">Sími:</span> <a href={SITE.phoneHref} class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 transition-colors">{SITE.phone}</a></li>
        <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-900">Staðsetning:</span> {SITE.location}</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
